  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "text": "In the photos, the clothes look like they are of good quality, but when you receive them as a customer, you receive the footpath quality. I always make sure to check photos uploaded by reviewers, at least I see the real colour and quality then.",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "UgxL5BMpnYSYLdDJik94AaABAg",
      "date": "2023-11-20",
      "confidence": 0.94,
      "tags": [
        "authentic_photo_reviews"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "The product details specified a 'regular fit,' but I received a 'relaxed fit' in a completely different color. Why am I being penalized with return fees and a non-refundable ₹30 platform fee for a mistake made entirely by your team?",
      "source": "Play Store",
      "source_id": "205ad5f3-2687-47ba-a505-f60bd3b42e3b",
      "date": "2026-08-13",
      "confidence": 0.93,
      "tags": [
        "fit_and_return_fees"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "In online there is no scope to try, so basically you have to take few more pieces than you wanted and whatever don't look good on you, you have to return..but Myntra took convience fees for those extra return..so, had to stop buying from Myntra..",
      "source": "YouTube",
      "source_id": "UgwYb-BW0jI6I4C0hYx4AaABAg",
      "date": "2023-11-07",
      "confidence": 0.91,
      "tags": [
        "return_policy_barrier"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "I ordered a denim skirt in 32 waist size, which was tight on me, so I exchanged it for a 34 size but received it in a different blue shade. I want the original navy blue shade. Now my size has gone in the app.",
      "source": "PissedConsumer",
      "source_id": "pc_p12_2412503",
      "date": "2026-08-17",
      "confidence": 0.89,
      "tags": [
        "size_chart_gap"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it better to buy kurti suits from Myntra or from the sites of brands like Libas? I recently purchased one Libas kurta set from Myntra and loved the quality. Will there be a difference in quality or prices?",
      "source": "Reddit",
      "source_id": "reddit_t3_1fy9rps",
      "date": "2024-10-07",
      "confidence": 0.87,
      "tags": [
        "cross_platform_comparison"
      ],
      "segment": "millennial"
    }
  ],
